  "_comment": "How each rarity's foil is drawn over a card, read by client/collection/FoilEffect. Boxes are fractions of the card image (left, top, right, bottom). A layer draws a foil texture (textures/foil/<texture>.png) over boxes: mode 'pattern' drifts it slowly, 'sheen' sweeps it as a glare, 'flat' takes its middle as one color. It is added (blend 'add', the default: black adds nothing) or multiplied with the card at 'strength' (blend 'multiply': colors white parts). 'ghost' turns the art into a pale silver hologram. 'use' pulls in a preset. Preview the looks with tools/textures/preview_foils.py.",
